# Cleanup T3 Enforcement Resources

This plan describes the steps to remove AWS resources created for the T3 enforcement task.

## User Review Required
> [!WARNING]
> This will permanently delete the specified AWS Config Rule, SSM Document, and IAM Role.

## Proposed Changes
I will create and run a shell script `cleanup_t3_enforcement.sh` to perform the following:

### AWS Config
#### [DELETE] Remediation Configuration
- For Config Rule: `t3_enforcement_2026_01_11_rule`

#### [DELETE] Config Rule
- Name: `t3_enforcement_2026_01_11_rule`

### Systems Manager (SSM)
