- Role Name: `t3_enforcement_2026_01_11_AutomationRole`
- Detach Policy: `arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/service-role/AmazonSSMAutomationRole`
- Delete Instance Profile (if exists): `t3_enforcement_2026_01_11_AutomationRole`

